  "content": "\n\n===== FILE: index.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>长川银行 - 首页</title>\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n        header { background-color: #007BFF; color: white; padding: 10px 0; }\n        .header-content { width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }\n        .logo { float: left; }\n        .nav { float: right; }\n        .nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 0 15px; }\n        .nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n        .main { margin-top: 20px; }\n        .banner { width: 100%; height: 300px; background: url('banner.jpg') no-repeat center center; background-size: cover; }\n        .services { margin-top: 20px; }\n        .service { width: 30%; float: left; margin: 0 1.67%; padding: 10px; }\n        .service img { width: 100%; height: auto; }\n        .service h2 { margin: 5px 0; }\n        .footer { background-color: #333; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0; position: relative; bottom: 0; width: 100%; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">\n                <img src=\"logo.png\" alt=\"长川银行\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nav\">\n                <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n                <a href=\"personal.html\">个人银行服务</a>\n                <a href=\"credit.html\">信用卡</a>\n                <a href=\"contact.html\">联系我们</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n        <div class=\"banner\"></div>\n        <div class=\"services\">\n            <div class=\"service\">\n                <img src=\"accounts.png\" alt=\"账户服务\">\n                <h2>账户服务</h2>\n                <p>提供多种储蓄和投资账户。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service\">\n                <img src=\"card.png\" alt=\"银行卡服务\">\n                <h2>银行卡服务</h2>\n                <p>多种银行卡选择，满足不同需求。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service\">\n                <img src=\"loan.png\" alt=\"贷款服务\">\n                <h2>贷款服务</h2>\n                <p>个人和小企业贷款，灵活还款计划。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>版权所有 &copy; 长川银行</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: personal.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>长川银行 - 个人银行服务</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">\n                <img src=\"logo.png\" alt=\"长川银行\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nav\">\n                <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n                <a href=\"personal.html\">个人银行服务</a>\n                <a href=\"credit.html\">信用卡</a>\n                <a href=\"contact.html\">联系我们</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n        <h1>个人银行服务</h1>\n        <p>长川银行为您提供以下个人银行服务：</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>储蓄账户</li>\n            <li>支票账户</li>\n            <li>投资账户</li>\n            <li>网上银行服务</li>\n            <li>手机银行服务</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>版权所有 &copy; 长川银行</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: credit.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>长川银行 - 信用卡</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">\n                <img src=\"logo.png\" alt=\"长川银行\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nav\">\n                <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n                <a href=\"personal.html\">个人银行服务</a>\n                <a href=\"credit.html\">信用卡</a>\n                <a href=\"contact.html\">联系我们</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n        <h1>信用卡服务</h1>\n        <p>长川银行提供多种信用卡，以满足不同客户的需求：</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>标准信用卡</li>\n            <li>金卡</li>\n            <li>白金卡</li>\n            <li>商务卡</li>\n            <li>学生卡</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>每张信用卡都有其独特的功能和优惠。</p>\n    </div>\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>版权所有 &copy; 长川银行</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: contact.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>长川银行 - 联系我们</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">\n                <img src=\"logo.png\" alt=\"长川银行\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nav\">\n                <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n                <a href=\"personal.html\">个人银行服务</a>\n                <a href=\"credit.html\">信用卡</a>\n                <a href=\"contact.html\">联系我们</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n        <h1>联系我们</h1>\n        <p>长川银行全国网点信息：</p>\n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <th>城市</th>\n                <th>地址</th>\n                <th>电话</th>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>北京</td>\n                <td>北京市朝阳区XX路XX号</td>\n                <td>010-12345678</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>上海</td>\n                <td>上海市浦东新区XX路XX号</td>\n                <td>021-12345678</td>\n            </tr>\n            <!-- More rows for other cities -->\n        </table>\n    </div>\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>版权所有 &copy; 长川银行</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: styles.css =====\nbody { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nheader { background-color: #007BFF; color: white; padding: 10px 0; }\n.header-content { width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }\n.logo { float: left; }\n.nav { float: right; }\n.nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 0 15px; }\n.nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n.main { margin-top: 20px; }\n.banner { width: 100%; height: 300px; background: url('banner.jpg') no-repeat center center; background-size: cover; }\n.services { margin-top: 20px; }\n.service { width: 30%; float: left; margin: 0 1.67%; padding: 10px; }\n.service img { width: 100%; height: auto; }\n.footer { background-color: #333; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0; position: relative; bottom: 0; width: 100%; }"
